   </title>
   <indicator ascending="0" measure="5">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Output Indicator</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Number of solar based rural health/education facilities piloted</narrative>
    </description>
    <baseline year="2020">
     <comment>
      <narrative xml:lang="EN">4</narrative>
     </comment>
    </baseline>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2022-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2022-12-31"></period-end>
     <target>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">-Hire CSO to train 45 women from Grand Cape Mount, Gbarpolu and Bomi in eco-stove production and group them in small scale enterprises for production and sales of eco-stove (produce 450 stoves)

- Complete GCF Solar for Health funding proposal</narrative>
      </comment>
     </target>
     <actual>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">- CSO hired and 45 women trained in eco-stove production and income potentials for participating women increased.

- Proposal development about 90% completed.</narrative>
      </comment>
     </actual>
    </period>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2021-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2021-12-31"></period-end>
     <target>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">Completion and commissioning of two solar facilities at two counties service centers

Completion and submission of one regional solar for health funding proposal to GCF</narrative>
      </comment>
     </target>
     <actual>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">Completed and commissioned one 12KVA solar facility at one county service center in River Cess. Service delivery at the center has significantly improved.

The development of the GCF solar for health funding proposal is ongoing. Expected to be completed and submitted by end of March 2022.</narrative>
      </comment>
     </actual>
    </period>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2020-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2020-12-31"></period-end>
     <target>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">12 health facilities and 1 county service center powered by solar energy</narrative>
      </comment>
     </target>
     <actual>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sustained power provided and Health care delivery improved at 12 health facilities and contract offered for installation of solar facilities at 1 county service center.</narrative>
      </comment>
     </actual>
    </period>
   </indicator>
